# 10_plasmaball: the flight effects of the plasma bolt and of the BFG's ball alone, hung in the air by fxTest:
# unstable balls that throw off particles, sparks and arcs. From a few steps away, then each close up.
map game/cpuboss
at 0 god
at 0 notarget
at 0 ui_showGun 0
at 0 g_showHud 0
at 1 setviewpos -32 1850 188 55
at 20 fxTest fx_plasma_fly 90 -45
at 20 fxTest fx_bfg_fly 130 45
at 480 fxTest
at 481 fxTest fx_plasma_fly 30
at 960 fxTest
at 961 fxTest fx_bfg_fly 80
end 1500
capture 24 1500 every=8 fps=60
